# Keeps the Fly.io build context (repo root, see website/server/Dockerfile)
# small and fast -- without this, the whole monorepo (including every
# node_modules tree, git history, and the unrelated client app) gets
# uploaded to the builder on every deploy.
.git
.claude
node_modules
**/node_modules
website/client
web
handover
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.docx
*.jpg
.DS_Store
